    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PAA\nConquest\nof the Pacific\nJULY 1940\nRETURN FLIGHT FROM NEW ZEALAND TO SAN FRANCISCO\nNEW ZEALAND\nThe System of the Flying\nClippers\nTHE RETURN FLIGHT\nON THE VIS - TO - NEW\nZEALAND ROUTE LEFT\nAUCKLAND ON JULY 19,\n1,940 WITH STOPS, AS\nSHOWN ON THE CACHET,\nAT NEW CALEDONIA,\nCANTON ISLAND, AND\nHAWAII.\nBAGGAGE LABEL USED BY\nPAN ANGRICAN ON THIS ROUTE",
